 "name_en": "Solution Quotation – Advanced Product Bundling (7WT)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Solution Quotation – Advanced Product Bundling (7WT)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio950590ddcc704367b3caaf034941ba11\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio950590ddcc704367b3caaf034941ba11__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The new Solution Quotation feature enhances the existing quotation process by integrating Advanced Variant Configuration (AVC), enabling customers to configure both single-level and multi-level variant products within a quotation. This functionality allows for the creation and maintenance of solution quotations that include configurable materials and configurable solution bundle products.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">With the Solution Bundle Product capability, users can combine multiple configurable items into a single structured quotation. The system supports maintaining a product hierarchy, facilitating the inclusion of complex configurations and nested components tailored to specific business needs.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio950590ddcc704367b3caaf034941ba11__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Support for single-level and multi-level variant configuration of products using AVC.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Ability to create and update solution quotations containing configurable materials.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Enablement of solution bundle products, allowing users to group various configurable items into a structured and hierarchical solution quotation.</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio950590ddcc704367b3caaf034941ba11__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\">\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Greater Flexibility in Solution Offering</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Ensuring accurate representation of customer-specific product combinations and dependencies.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Seamless handling of complex configuration scenarios, aligning with diverse business use cases across industries.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Increased Customer Satisfaction and Win Rates</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio950590ddcc704367b3caaf034941ba11__non_standard\">\n      <p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph emphasis\">Exclude from Default Activation</span></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio950590ddcc704367b3caaf034941ba11__non_standard_reason\">\n      <p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph emphasis\">Reason for Excluding from Default Activation</span></p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Advance Variant Configuration is required</p>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>解决方案报价 – 高级产品捆绑 (7WT)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio950590ddcc704367b3caaf034941ba11\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio950590ddcc704367b3caaf034941ba11__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">新的解决方案报价功能通过集成高级变式配置 (AVC) 来增强现有报价流程，使客户能够在报价中配置单级和多级变式产品。此功能允许创建和维护解决方案报价，其中包括可配置物料和可配置解决方案包产品。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过解决方案包产品功能，用户可以将多个可配置项目合并到一个结构化报价中。系统支持维护产品层次结构，便于包含针对特定业务需求定制的复杂配置和嵌套组件。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio950590ddcc704367b3caaf034941ba11__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">支持使用 AVC 的产品的单级和多级变式配置。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">能够创建和更新包含可配置物料的解决方案报价。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">启用解决方案包产品，允许用户将各种可配置项目分组到结构化和分层的解决方案报价中。</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio950590ddcc704367b3caaf034941ba11__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\">\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">提高解决方案产品的灵活性</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">确保准确表示客户特定产品组合和相关性。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">无缝处理复杂的配置场景，与跨行业的各种业务用例保持一致。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提高客户满意度和赢单率</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio950590ddcc704367b3caaf034941ba11__non_standard\">\n      <p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph emphasis\">从默认激活中排除</span></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio950590ddcc704367b3caaf034941ba11__non_standard_reason\">\n      <p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph emphasis\">从缺省激活中排除的原因</span></p>\n      <p class=\"p\">需要高级变式配置</p>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
